                   >{`/<handle>/<slug>`}</code>
                   ) and on your profile page (
                   <code
                     style={{ fontFamily: "var(--font-typewriter)" }}
                   >{`/<handle>`}</code>
                   ). You can change it; the old handle is freed immediately.
                 </p>

                 {store.handleToast && (
                   <p
                     class="mb-3 text-[0.65rem] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-[var(--color-accent-green)]"
